      "writtenOn": "2026-07-21T09:08:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed, relying on execution order is fragile. I split the suite into three independent sources, each linked into its own binary and run as a separate test suite. No other test can initialize the controller first because the not-ready and S5-callback cases build separately. So they\u0027re no longer order-dependent.",
